13194139534641 true] [17592186300631 1111 #uuid "81303778-c0bf-59b9-8ff9-75a5717f87a8" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300632 1034 "no solutions" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300632 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534641 true] [17592186300632 1111 #uuid "2136567f-782c-5036-8093-c4022d3e5876" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300633 1034 "x<\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300633 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300633 1111 #uuid "3da5bd22-6bdc-5fb9-8557-76136b98c398" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1017 #edb/ref 17592186300635 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1089 "q-115410" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1100 "Solve the inequality $\\frac{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}}{(0.6)^{3x-2}}<0.$" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1113 #uuid "29e3d62b-d100-50a8-8289-45e98db458c6" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300634 1145 "When we have an inequality involving an exponential function with a positive base, we're allowed to multiply or divide both sides by the exponential function.\n\nMultiplying both sides of the given inequality by $(0.6)^{3x-2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}}{(0.6)^{3x-2}} & <0 \\\\ (0.6)^{3x-2}\\cdot \\frac{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}}{(0.6)^{3x-2}} & <(0.6)^{3x-2}\\cdot 0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-4)^{3} & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve the inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{({x}^{2}-4)^{3}} & <\\sqrt[3]{0} \\\\ {x}^{2}-4 & <0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & <4 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & <\\sqrt{4} \\\\ |x| & <2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality is $-2<x<2.$" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300636 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300637 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300638 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300639 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300640 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1041 "selection" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1104 #edb/ref 17592186300639 13194139534641 true] [17592186300635 1110 #uuid "1011c311-018e-53cb-846e-56fb5080e8eb" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300636 1034 "all real numbers" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300636 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534641 true] [17592186300636 1111 #uuid "b8f03f67-cbf3-5232-bf22-ba3d279ea411" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300637 1034 "x<-2" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300637 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300637 1111 #uuid "46580a3e-f091-5d54-a45d-e2e6573aec63" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300638 1034 "no solutions" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300638 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534641 true] [17592186300638 1111 #uuid "5fc66538-8e90-5708-a442-79c29c5089a9" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300639 1034 "-2<x<2" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300639 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300639 1111 #uuid "8ff8bf2b-011b-5172-ae59-104a9f628c9a" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300640 1034 "x>0" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300640 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300640 1111 #uuid "271a0841-346a-56be-8d84-3edc4cc0f80b" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1017 #edb/ref 17592186300642 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1089 "q-115429" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1100 "Solve the inequality $5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}\\ge -2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}.$" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1113 #uuid "3754b800-5aa3-5f3a-a9b9-6e9a52514d6c" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300641 1145 "First, we move all the terms to the left side of the inequality and factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} & \\ge -2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} \\\\ 5x\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+4\\cdot {7}^{2x+3}+2\\cdot {7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+4+2){7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0 \\\\ (5x+6){7}^{2x+3} & \\ge 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${7}^{2x+3}$ and solve the resulting inequality using familiar techniques:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+6 & \\ge 0 \\\\ 5x & \\ge -6 \\\\ x & \\ge -\\frac{6}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to the inequality above is $x\\ge -\\frac{6}{5}.$" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300643 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300644 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300645 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300646 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300647 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1041 "selection" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1104 #edb/ref 17592186300644 13194139534641 true] [17592186300642 1110 #uuid "65963c00-0a90-56b3-be61-6ec87889c2d5" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300643 1034 "x\\ge \\frac{5}{4}" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300643 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300643 1111 #uuid "dd0d5925-ae67-5cd7-a980-635fed6b60e7" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300644 1034 "x\\ge -\\frac{6}{5}" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300644 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300644 1111 #uuid "a8e3bc25-6b40-57f4-aeb7-042bb248b5b5" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300645 1034 "x\\ge 7" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300645 1111 #uuid "eb4f80f8-ffe7-59f5-9e15-5dc18ac86477" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300646 1034 "x\\ge \\frac{7}{2}" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300646 1111 #uuid "4d04f1d3-5f95-5586-9004-29a38c36ce0f" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300647 1034 "x\\ge -2" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300647 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300647 1111 #uuid "2941a21b-101a-53d0-85d8-cdb1a206a193" 1319413953