g both sides of the given inequality by ${6}^{3x-2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(49-{x}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2} & \\le 0 \\\\ \\frac{(49-{x}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {6}^{3x-2}}{{6}^{3x-2}} & \\le \\frac{0}{{6}^{3x-2}} \\\\ (49-{x}^{2})^{3} & \\le 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can solve the inequality using familiar methods:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{(49-{x}^{2})^{3}} & \\le \\sqrt[3]{0} \\\\ 49-{x}^{2} & \\le 0 \\\\ -{x}^{2} & \\le -49 \\\\ {x}^{2} & \\ge 49 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & \\ge \\sqrt{49} \\\\ |x| & \\ge 7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we had to flip the sign again of the inequality since we divided by a negative number ($-1$).\n\nTherefore, the solution to the inequality is $x\\le -7$ or $x\\ge 7.$" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300693 13194139534641 true] [17592186300692 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534641 true] [17592186300692 1041 "field-1" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300692 1104 #edb/ref 17592186300693 13194139534641 true] [17592186300692 1110 #uuid "43ff7341-8644-51ac-afe1-ef0830dc3ff3" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300693 1034 "-7" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300693 1111 #uuid "cd362e21-5cdd-541a-a773-a0032f6122ac" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300695 13194139534641 true] [17592186300694 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534641 true] [17592186300694 1041 "field-2" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300694 1104 #edb/ref 17592186300695 13194139534641 true] [17592186300694 1110 #uuid "c4eadecf-dab9-5909-aa1a-f51ff976603c" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300695 1034 "\\ge" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534641 true] [17592186300695 1111 #uuid "d7258ae2-184d-53bb-9f3a-43d391713394" 13194139534641 true] [17592186300696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186300697 13194139534641 true] [17592186300696 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534641 true] [17592186300696 1041 "field-3" 13194139534641 